Z||000000||bigpacupacu||08-21-2001||01:39 PM||||I thought of a way ti customize my interior by using contact paper on the dash and shifter plates. Just to see what it looked like , I went for a black marble look.<BR>Check it out and tell me what you think.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.spotlife.com/users2/bigpacupacu/webalbum/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.spotlife.com/users2/bigpacupacu/webalbum/</A> <P>------------------<BR>Steven Poole<BR>85GT 4sp||||reg||1
Z||000001||MinnGreenGT||08-21-2001||01:47 PM||||Certainly different. Not totally sure I like it...but I also don't think it's terrible. I had considered doing a green-marble in my GT, but have decided to save up for a nice wood grain kit.  Nice work though- looks like a good clean install.<P>BTW- Welcome to the forum!<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg">     <P>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
